tracks/0/keys = {
"times": PackedFloat32Array(0),
"transitions": PackedFloat32Array(1),
"update": 1,
"values": ["As the dangers of the [color=purple]TOWER[/color] became undeniable,
the people of [color=yellow]STARSPIRE[/color] sought structure amid the risk.

Thus, the [color=aqua]STARSPIRE HUNTERS COMMITTEE[/color] was established:
a pragmatic guild formed to organize expeditions,
minimize losses,

and ensure the [color=purple]TOWER’S[/color] riches were… properly managed.
"]
}
