"transitions": PackedFloat32Array(1),
"update": 1,
"values": ["Though many have entered the [color=purple]TOWER[/color],
none have ever passed the [color=orange]FIFTH FLOOR[/color].

And while [color=green]VELMORIA[/color] delights in the novelties
the [color=purple]TOWER[/color] provides,

one question lingers unanswered…
"]
}
