"transitions": PackedFloat32Array(1),
"update": 1,
"values": ["Though none have passed the fifth floor,
the [color=purple]TOWER[/color] remains.

It has stood.
It has waited.

And now, [color=green]YOU[/color] stand before it.

Today is [color=green]your[/color] Hunter's Exam. 
Do you have what it takes to become a [color=aqua]Starspire Hunter[/color]?


"]
}
